      "text": "[3:45PM] #Okota_Isolo #TrafficUpdate \n\n The stretch from 5 Star connecting to Iyana Isolo has fast-moving traffic, and the Daleko-Mushin bridge is clear. Similarly, the Oke-Afa bridge has fast traffic towards Pako and outbound directions. From Pako, the routes connecting to Akiti and Chemist, as well as the Ago roundabout and Ibeh Road, are also showing good traffic flow in both directions. \n\nThe counterflow lane from Lasutech roundabout through Limca junction, Aiye, Omonije, College, Ishaga, Ile Ibadan, Ire Akari, and Kogberegbe is also moving at a fast pace. Traffic from Cele towards Ago Palace is fast in both directions. The Ilasa-Transformer to Apata junction route is clear with good flow in both directions.\n\n Finally, the Cele Ijesha link bridge is experiencing fast but busy traffic, and the stretch from Ilasa and Ballet towards Ijesha inbound to Mile 2 is reporting fast traffic conditions. No impediments to traffic have been observed at this time.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
