      "text": "[3:53PM] #MobolajiBankAnthony #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic is slightly busy along the service lane, Anthony inward journey Maryland intersection, and onwards to Odo'yalaro.\nMovement is good at Maryland inward journey Mobolaji Bank Anthony Way, but slightly busy on the other side towards Maryland Intersection.\n\nTraffic is slightly busy along Kodesoh Road inward and outward journey.\nGood flow of traffic on Oba Akran Road/Bridge, Local Airport Road/Bridge, Oba Akinjobi Way, and Ikeja G.R.A.\n\nOur personnel are effectively managing traffic at their respective locations, ensuring ease of movement. \n\n#FollowLASTMA",
